{"author":451,"label":"Manas Ranjan Mahapatra","poems":[{"id":744,"source_language":"or","variants":{"or":{"label":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","title":"ଦିନେ ଫେରିବାବେଳେ ଅନ୍ଧାରରେ","kind":"Original","stanzas":[["ଅଂଧାରରେ ଫେରିବାବେଳେ ସେଦିନ","ବଂଧୁ କହିଲେ : ଦେଖିକରି ଯିବ","ଭୂତଠୁ, ଚୋରକୁ ,ସାପଠୁ","ନିଜକୁ ବଂଚେଇ"],["ମୁଁ ହସିଲି","ଉତ୍ତର ଦେଲି : ଅଂଧାରରେ ହୁଏତ","ଭୂତ ,ଚୋର ବା ସାପ","ଆଲୁଅରେ ତ ଅନେକ କ୍ଷତର ଭିଡ଼ !"],["କ୍ଷୟକାଶ ପରି ସଂକ୍ରମିତ","ପ୍ରତି ଛାତିରେ","ତା`ଠୁ ଅନେକ ଭଲ","ଫେରିଯିବା ଚୁପଚାପ୍","ଭୂତ, ଚୋର ବା ସାପଂକ ସହ","ଅଂଧାରରେ !"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"en":{"label":"English","title":"One Day, Returning in the Dark","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["That day, as I was returning in the dark,","a friend said: watch your step,","keep yourself safe","from ghosts, thieves and snakes."],["I laughed.","I answered: in the dark there may be","ghosts, thieves or snakes,","but in the light there is a crowd of wounds!"],["Spreading like consumption","in every chest.","Far better than that","to return quietly","with ghosts, thieves or snakes,","in the dark!"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"hi":{"label":"हिन्दी","title":"एक दिन अँधेरे में लौटते हुए","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["उस दिन अँधेरे में लौटते समय","मित्र ने कहा: सँभलकर जाना,","भूतों, चोरों, साँपों से","अपने को बचाकर।"],["मैं हँसा।","उत्तर दिया: अँधेरे में शायद हों","भूत, चोर या साँप,","उजाले में तो कितने घावों की भीड़ है!"],["क्षयरोग की तरह फैलती हुई","हर छाती में।","उससे कहीं अच्छा है","चुपचाप लौट जाना","भूतों, चोरों या साँपों के साथ,","अँधेरे में!"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]}},"end_mark":"sprig","author":"Manas Ranjan Mahapatra","route":"poem-744.html","portrait":"assets/writers/451-earth-voice-v1-64.webp","illustration":null,"availability":""}]}
